  "name": "Water Attunement",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Water_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You channel the water through your body, making your movements swift and fluid.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Defense</strong> increases by <strong>1</strong>, and your <strong>Stride</strong> speed increases by <strong>5</strong>.</p><p>Once per turn, if a melee attack misses you, you may immediately force the attacker to make an <strong>Reflex</strong> check or fall prone, as you strike them with an opportunistic blast of water.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the bonus to <strong>Defense</strong> by 1 per extra success, or <strong>Stride</strong> by 1 per 2 extra successes.</p>",
